433	     * Counts the existing owners that, before this create, already share the given first name and
434	     * last name. Both names are compared case-insensitively with surrounding and internal whitespace
435	     * collapsed, consistent with the other owner-name comparisons. The owner being created has not
436	     * been saved yet, so it is never included in the count.
