496	    /**
497	     * Rejects creation of an owner whose city already contains the maximum number of owners
498	     * ({@value #CITY_CAPACITY}). Owners are counted per city case-insensitively with surrounding and
499	     * internal whitespace collapsed, consistent with the other owner-field comparisons.
