622	     * Rejects creation of an owner whose last name and address both match an existing owner's,
623	     * which marks them as belonging to the same household. Both the last name and the address are
624	     * compared case-insensitively with surrounding and internal whitespace collapsed, so values
625	     * that differ only in letter case or spacing are still treated as a match.
626	     *
627	     * @param lastName the last name of the owner being created
628	     * @param address  the address of the owner being created
629	     * @throws DuplicateOwnerHouseholdException if another owner already shares this last name and
630	     *                                          address, yielding a 409 Conflict response
631	     */
632	    private void rejectDuplicateHousehold(String lastName, String address) {
